        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin KOD-RAE, Arched Kodiak Handleset with Matching Rustic Arched Escutcheon</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic styling of the Kodiak Entrance Set makes it a great choice for traditional homes. This entrance set has a rustic feel that is growing in popularity in the world of home decorating. The covered deadbolt grants it a little something extra--the perfect finishing touch. The Kodiak Handleset is available in either dark bronze or white bronze finishes. Choose from emergency egress single cylinder or dummy functions. As part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection, it has a 25 year finish warranty and a lifetime manufacturer's warranty. It will fit most predrilled 2-1/8 inch bore hole doors. The adjustable latch will fit 2-3/8 inch backsets or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It will fit 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses all the way up to 2-1/2 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Kodiak Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Kodiak Covered Deadbolt Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Length: 10-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 3-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Escutcheon Width: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Escutcheon Length: 10-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-13/32\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Kodiak Entrance Set with Rustic Arched Escutcheon",
                "description": "The classic styling of the Kodiak Entrance Set makes it a great choice for traditional homes. This entrance set has a rustic feel that is growing in popularity in the world of home decorating. The covered deadbolt grants it a little something extra--the perfect finishing touch. The Kodiak Handleset is available in either dark bronze or white bronze finishes. Choose from emergency egress single cylinder or dummy functions. As part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection, it has a 25 year finish warranty and a lifetime manufacturer's warranty. It will fit most predrilled 2-1/8 inch bore hole doors. The adjustable latch will fit 2-3/8 inch backsets or 2-3/4 inch backsets. It will fit 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses all the way up to 2-1/2 inches.",
